<title>SINGAPORE: Asiamatrix 1996 loss at S$3.23 mln.</title>
<headline>Asiamatrix 1996 loss at S$3.23 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollar unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			 3.23  vs   4.93</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	12.87  vs  20.98</p>
<p>    Turnover			 4.75  vs   7.35</p>
<p>    Other income incl int	0.07  vs   0.01</p>
<p>    Interest expense	     0.55  vs   0.60</p>
<p>    Pretax loss		    3.23  vs   4.87</p>
<p>    Tax				nil   vs   0.06</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		0.53  vs   nil</p>
<p>Note - Asiamatrix Ltd said it made an extraordinary gain of Singapore S$527,696 from selling its interests in various companies.</p>
<p>The company manufactures and sells plastic injection moulded components and injection moulds.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
